{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260lQ6fLGzWC1795443719.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>宏福苑業主立案法團委任管理人合安管理有限公司，將於下月8日召開業主周年大會。</p><p></p><p>合安向業主發通告，指業主周年大會將於在下月8日晚上7時，在大埔社區中心召開，會議議程包括管理人匯報屋苑財務狀況、討論及議決選聘2026年、財政年度核數師等。</p><p></p><p>合安指，為有序協調相關安排，建議業主即日起至12月3日中午登入宏福苑業主立案法團委任管理人網頁登記。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:02:29.806116+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:19.546947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:55:49.298386+00:00","content_hash":"0a4cebdb4ba8f8fa9c1c94a4649b7a42b78db727fecc75eb0b6c3e741cbfa7b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}